OL,3,GNEWSAI've waited four months to bury my
OL,4,Ason after delay in returning brain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grieving mother has said she has been
OL,7,Fwaiting for more than four months to
OL,8,Fbury her son after delays to
OL,9,Fpost-mortem examination tests on his
OL,10,Fbrain.
OL,12,FPhil Malone, 39, died at the Queen's
OL,13,FMedical Centre (QMC) in Nottingham on 8
OL,14,FJune, five weeks after suffering a
OL,15,Fbleed on the brain. The organ was
OL,16,Fremoved after the coroner asked for
OL,17,Ftests to determine a cause of death.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
