OL,3,GNEWSAI've waited four months to bury my
OL,4,Ason after delay in returning brain
OL,5,
OL,6,FLyn Malone, who lives in Melton
OL,7,FMowbray, Leicestershire, said she was
OL,8,Finitially told it would take 10 weeks,
OL,9,Fbut 16 weeks after his death, she had
OL,10,Fstill not been able to bury him.
OL,12,FShe has now been told that the tests
OL,13,Fhave been completed and the body has
OL,14,Fbeen returned to the undertaker, but
OL,15,FLyn said it had taken a huge toll on
OL,16,Fher.
